; ModifierBoneTarget3D: no visuals, exercises bone_name and bone.
; Parented under a Skeleton3D, the only parent that resolves get_skeleton()
; (skeleton_modifier_3d.cpp:51), so this is the shape Godot would write.
; `influence` is absent on purpose: this class strips it to a bare
; PROPERTY_USAGE_READ_ONLY (modifier_bone_target_3d.cpp:72-74), which carries no
; STORAGE bit, so Godot never serialises it here.

